WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.560
After Wen Tianxiang was captured, he passed Lingdingyang and wrote a poem that would be handed down through the ages.

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:15.998
The poem says: since ancient times, who has not died? Leave a loyal heart to shine in history.

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:21.604
These fourteen characters spoke the conviction of his whole life.

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:27.378
These two lines expressed his resolve to hold fast to his beliefs even in the face of death.

00:00:27.728 --> 00:00:32.504
His gaze turned toward the distance, his heart completely at peace.

00:00:32.854 --> 00:00:41.302
A danxin is a loyal, devoted heart; hanqing is the history book that records the past.

00:00:41.652 --> 00:00:45.372
The red heart symbolizes a loyalty that never changes.

00:00:45.722 --> 00:00:53.810
From then on, these two lines became one of the most famous lines in Chinese culture.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:01:01.024
Whenever people read these two lines, they think of Wen Tianxiang's awe-inspiring integrity.

